  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-visits-the-aquarium-v2-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "041be5fe462aed6e2174544f853f0703fa57a03e1977b522775452071fe02da1",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "007369ad16b787f9541372a0e20d081cb6989a00dd167d0bf3da20355947f323",
      "text": "悟空逛\n水族馆",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ab0c3bcd01854f6903dc43e78840e6520d86a22058e8db3367a98c68348ad588",
      "text": "悟空带来一张空白小卡片。\n“我要挑一样最喜欢的，把它画\n下来！”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4bff45daad86c2578ccee1a7bec0a321485a187a5c3efdc44ebd57620b435bd7",
      "text": "高高的海带在水里轻轻摇。\n“哇，海底也有一片森林！”\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1f69a79826da5e39f08480eebfabbe1c5255faf9c18ebbb1c17b87ce77143900",
      "text": "一条橘色小鱼钻进海带丛。\n“咦，你躲到哪儿去了？”\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "860373900d32c9f4ca79c4215a633f801ce0ba96cf7510d6d8b2bf73b5357873",
      "text": "悟空左看看，右瞧瞧。\n尾巴也跟着忙个不停。\n小鱼却还躲着。\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e2a5ddc87925715b397c5d295338aecd58e78c605077afb66119b7a2c3c3b13d",
      "text": "敖丙站着没动。\n“别急，我们在这里等一等。”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "69cb1cbfad3c8aa135015a641a930b1b2c9a45cdf7893c5ef8b0927bc43d3722",
      "text": "海带摇呀摇，\n一张橘色的小脸探了出来。\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e23cf74489e3e3ad23d45128318429552048d2f750f7ead0402a548530b1b72a",
      "text": "“找到你啦！”\n悟空举起小卡片。\n“就画这一幕，好不好？”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9e5bd093ed4f18d1610fcd7468cd45863676e79ce6a0ff3f02c2338d64da6a67",
      "text": "前面，一扇展窗泛着蓝光。\n水母在里面轻轻飘。\n悟空也放慢了脚步。\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "450e283f9378fa155d2a0661c0258cca32c159b7324a750a10090a966df40b56",
      "text": "一只水母轻轻一张，又一收。\n“像不像一把小雨伞？”\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "195074c1a34651a45ccb940a4298e4e0020a93865482893fb4dcb7ee0e1ad3ff",
      "text": "“是水母呀。”沙僧说。\n悟空也把两只手撑成小伞。\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5b018b889eea33901b47aa6f8bc2a2fa9751beb5a2ce86241a90a33938d671f7",
      "text": "“这个，我也想画！”\n可小卡片上，还是空空的。\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bfcf3bd88f7ebf4ff254f7c6096007acedbf89dc9b4e3419877b337ccaba8d30",
      "text": "来到下一扇展窗，\n海獭正仰着肚皮，漂在水面上。\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a92ae8de7e974f7572992270394a13877f5387d573f3e1bb85da01dbeb1e3fec",
      "text": "海獭用小爪子揉揉脸，\n又理理毛。\n“你也在洗脸呀？”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6c7c730f8d90839282c4c6ec54ffae06cac08a2efb50dd1dc657632d2e7832b5",
      "text": "悟空也搓搓毛茸茸的脸。\n“我的脸，也毛乎乎的！”\n敖丙咯咯笑了。\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5939e15d45d8dd61163409b7b16e1861f6662a50e01bb4ac4190d1cea0085d5a",
      "text": "小鱼，水母，还有海獭。\n“我都喜欢，选哪一个呢？”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "98a39b8d8b3257f61801fc4a41c5733960bcd64542fabc87bb445f67d6a7ec26",
      "text": "出了馆，他们在海边坐下来。\n沙僧把卡片放在长椅上。\n17",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-18.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3fa277137f200abcf4e30f526e4b46a360f9a0a3360e64710057e7f576a341cd",
      "text": "“画成三幅小画，不就行啦？”\n敖丙指指卡片。\n悟空画了三个小格子。\n18",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-19.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3ea30963c4a3667d0509a529b4e57b053f48930e945a0a5ffd7c0e7b6d84f2b1",
      "text": "海带丛里的小鱼，\n轻轻飘的水母，仰着漂的海獭。\n三格小画，装下好多开心的事。\n19",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-20.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "534037b27976a29d0dc2dabbf8ad213e641c2edbabda508edf07525d2658fcd8",
      "text": "悟空朝大海挥挥手。\n尾巴也弯一弯，\n轻轻挥了一下。\n20",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-21.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a2a0a5e82ccb3d7d450fa81617f21460ac2a26e51f130a83154778db134ebe17",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n谢谢你们一起读故事！\n希望你和孩子\n喜欢这次小小的冒险。\n更多免费故事\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh\n免费阅读、下载和打印。\n阅读更多免费故事\n如果喜欢这个故事，欢迎支持我继续创作。\n支持完全自愿。\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nPeihong Guo 创作\n故事与插画由 AI 辅助创作并经人工编辑。\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · 署名—非商业性使用—禁止演绎\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
